1
00:00:01,195 --> 00:00:03,730
As Uke comes to take both shoulders from behind,

2
00:00:03,731 --> 00:00:04,630
lead him to you

3
00:00:04,931 --> 00:00:06,669
as he comes round for the other shoulder

4
00:00:06,670 --> 00:00:08,801
step forward deeply and then cut down

5
00:00:09,102 --> 00:00:12,436
As you do so turn your body 
so Uke turns in front of you,

6
00:00:12,437 --> 00:00:15,770
step in again deeply raising his arm 
and turning your hips

7
00:00:16,071 --> 00:00:17,010
as you do so

8
00:00:17,011 --> 00:00:18,935
take him down in front of you for the throw.

